---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TestimonialSection from '../components/TestimonialSection.astro';
import GallerySection from '../components/GallerySection.astro';
---

<Layout title="Community Programs - EIEI">
  <style is:global>
    /* PREMIUM MODERN STYLES */
    .service-hero {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 45vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 10rem 2rem 5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e3a8a 100%);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .service-hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.05'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      opacity: 0.5;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .service-hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .service-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .service-hero p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      opacity: 0.9;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .main-content {
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 5rem 2rem;
      min-height: 50vh;
    }

    /* GALLERY SECTION */
    .gallery-section {
      padding: 80px 0;
      margin-top: 4rem;
    }
    
    .gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    
    .gallery :global(.gallery-item) {
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 250px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      transition: all 0.4s ease;
    }
    
    .gallery :global(.gallery-item:hover) {
      transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    
    .gallery :global(.gallery-item img) {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
      background: #eff6ff;
      color: #2563eb;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .breadcrumb {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #64748b;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .breadcrumb a {
      color: #2563eb;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    .breadcrumb a:hover {
      color: #f97316;
    }

    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
      margin-top: 4rem;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .initiatives-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 5rem;
    }

    .initiative-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 4rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .initiative-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; width: 6px; height: 100%;
      background: #2563eb;
    }

    .initiative-card:nth-child(even)::before {
      background: #f97316;
    }
    
    .initiative-card:nth-child(even) {
      grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    }

    .initiative-graphic {
      width: 100%;
      height: 300px;
      background: #eff6ff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 4rem;
      border: 2px dashed #93c5fd;
      position: relative;
    }
    
    .initiative-card:nth-child(even) .initiative-graphic {
      order: 2;
      background: #fff7ed;
      border-color: #fdba74;
    }

    .initiative-card:nth-child(even) .initiative-text {
      order: 1;
    }

    .initiative-text h3 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .initiative-text p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: #475569;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .newsletter-system {
      background: #0f172a;
      border-radius: 30px;
      padding: 5rem;
      color: white;
      margin: 5rem 0;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .newsletter-system::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; right: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(37,99,235,0.2) 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .newsletter-header {
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .newsletter-header h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: white;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .news-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .news-item {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }

    .news-item:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }

    .news-item h4 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: #f97316;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .news-item p {
      color: #cbd5e1;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .cta-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1e3a8a 100%);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 4rem;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      margin-top: 5rem;
    }

    .cta-banner h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #f97316;
      color: white;
      padding: 1.2rem 3rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .cta-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3);
      background: #ea580c;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .initiative-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 2rem; }
      .initiative-card:nth-child(even) { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .initiative-card:nth-child(even) .initiative-graphic { order: 1; }
      .initiative-card:nth-child(even) .initiative-text { order: 2; }
      .news-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .service-hero { padding-top: 8rem; min-height: 40vh; }
      .newsletter-system { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
      .cta-banner { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="service-hero">
    <div class="service-hero-content">
      <h1>Community Outreach & Programs</h1>
      <p>Partnering ruthlessly with major regional networks to forcibly stabilize safe, highly stimulating early learning environments.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="main-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/services">Services</a> / Community Outreach
      </div>

      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Active Community Pacts</h2>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">Review our active deployment contracts securing early childcare stability.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="initiatives-container">

        <div class="initiative-card">
          <div class="initiative-graphic">
            🌟
          </div>
          <div class="initiative-text">
            <h3>Pre-K Counts Lead Agency Command</h3>
            <p>EIEI secured absolute Lead Agency status from the prestigious Office of Child Development and Early Learning (OCDEL). Entrusted with tremendous oversight, EIEI massively funds and fundamentally supports six massive childcare grids entirely across Delaware and Philadelphia counties.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="initiative-card">
          <div class="initiative-graphic">
            🧠
          </div>
          <div class="initiative-text">
            <h3>SEL Curriculum Implementation</h3>
            <p>We are unleashing an intensive Social Emotional Learning (SEL) operational pilot deep within early childhood sectors. This framework utterly replaces toxic paradigms, forging executive function and advanced self-regulation protocols inside classrooms preventing catastrophic behavioral meltdowns instantly.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="initiative-card">
          <div class="initiative-graphic">
            ☎️
          </div>
          <div class="initiative-text">
            <h3>The Suspension "Warm Line" Matrix</h3>
            <p>An elite, non-threatening crisis line shielding panicked childcare providers. Rather than punitive state action, our peers provide absolutely immune, judgment-free operational counseling dismantling the threat of immediate child expulsion through extreme empathetic diplomacy and direct resource connections.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="initiative-card">
          <div class="initiative-graphic">
            🏆
          </div>
          <div class="initiative-text">
            <h3>NAFCC National Accreditation Strike</h3>
            <p>Armed by sub-grants from First Up, EIEI is aggressively forcing quality metrics up—coaching family-owned networks through the brutal compliance gauntlets required to achieve National Family Child Care integration status, heavily uplifting Pennsylvania's raw educational quality standards.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="initiative-card">
          <div class="initiative-graphic">
            🏫
          </div>
          <div class="initiative-text">
            <h3>K-12 District Takeovers</h3>
            <p>Infiltrating K-12 systems deeply, we lock administrative shields alongside Principals and PTAs. We deploy heavy-duty assessment scans identifying the deepest prioritized structural weaknesses, immediately bridging gaps with on-site, fully stacked service providers and operational funding levers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="newsletter-system">
        <div class="newsletter-header">
          <h2>State of the Institute Report</h2>
          <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 700px;">Internal dispatches tracking our massive geographical progress deploying educational dominance.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="news-grid">
          <div class="news-item">
            <h4>Black Child Advocacy Front</h4>
            <p>At the Philadelphia Regional Meeting for the Black Child Development Institute, we commanded the structural conversation entirely, dictating precisely how our massive metropolitan area must aggressively mobilize protective legislation for Black excellence in educational sectors.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="news-item">
            <h4>Pre-K Counts Graduation Impact</h4>
            <p>Dr. Essence Presley deployed an incredible keynote intervention at Community Concern #13, violently inspiring young graduations with unshakeable truth concerning empowerment, long-term survival intelligence, and boundless potential.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="news-item">
            <h4>Live Testimonial Feedback</h4>
            <p><em>"THANK YOU! You mercilessly pushed, believed, and relentlessly forced my program through the gauntlet. Exactly two brutal years later, under your absolute command, we are officially completely STAR 4 operational."</em> — Partner Provider</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="news-item">
            <h4>Educator Re-Ignition</h4>
            <p><em>"20 total years of combat in early childhood parameters, and this EIEI protocol completely obliterated my burnout, reigniting my passion instantly with incredibly lethal new administrative tools."</em> — Aixa Lopez, EIEI Graduate</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-banner">
        <h2>Merge Your Organization Today</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; opacity: 0.9; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto;">Does your structural grid require massive oversight, funding channels, and behavioral interventions? Request immediate integration.</p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="cta-button">Initiate Grant Proposal</a>
      </div>

      <GallerySection program="community-programs" />

      <TestimonialSection program="community-programs" />

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
